\item[S2] Hurtado, Ferran, Edge-Colouring Geometric Complete Graphs, Open Problem Garden, node 37084. Complete problem, discussion and bibliography (including mathematical image alt text). \url{https://www.openproblemgarden.org/op/edge_colouring_geometric_complete_graphs}.
